 4 ✓\n- Task 2: srd002-sys R2.2(w=1) + R2.3(w=1) + R2.4(w=1) + R2.5(w=1) = 4 ≤ 4 ✓\n- Task 3: srd001-testutils R2.5(w=1) + R2.6(w=1) + R3.1(w=1) + R3.2(w=1) = 4 ≤ 4 ✓\n\n```yaml\n- index: 0\n  title: \"[stitch] srd002-sys R1.5-R1.7, R2.1 -- Extended file metadata and TerminalWidth\"\n  dependency: -1\n  description: |\n    deliverable_type: code\n\n    required_reading:\n      - docs/specs/software-requirements/srd002-sys.yaml (requirements R1.5, R1.6, R1.7, R2.1)\n      - pkg/sys/ (existing implementation -- FileInfo struct, Stat, Lstat created by prior task for R1.1-R1.4)\n      - docs/ARCHITECTURE.yaml (pkg/sys component -- terminal size queries via TIOCGWINSZ ioctl)\n\n    files:\n      - path: pkg/sys/fileinfo.go\n        action: modify\n        note: Extend FileInfo-related functionality per R1.5-R1.7\n      - path: pkg/sys/terminal.go\n        action: create\n        note: TerminalWidth function per R2.1\n\n    requirements:\n      - id: R1\n        text: \"Implement srd002-sys R1.5 as specified in the SRD -- extend file metadata handling\"\n      - id: R2\n        text: \"Implement srd002-sys R1.6 as specified in the SRD -- extend file metadata handling\"\n      - id: R3\n        text: \"Implement srd002-sys R1.7 as specified in the SRD -- extend file metadata handling\"\n      - id: R4\n        text: \"Implement srd002-sys R2.1 as specified in the SRD -- TerminalWidth() (int, error) using TIOCGWINSZ ioctl\"\n\n    design_decisions:\n      - id: D1\n        text: \"Use golang.org/x/sys/unix for platform-specific syscall access (TIOCGWINSZ, Stat_t field mapping)\"\n      - id: D2\n        text: \"pkg/sys must not import any cmd/ package or any other pkg/ package\"\n      - id: D3\n        text: \"Follow signatures from the SRD exactly -- TerminalWidth returns (int, error)\"\n\n    acceptance_criteria:\n      - id: AC1\n        text: \"go build ./pkg/sys/... compiles without errors\"\n      - id: AC2\n        text: \"go vet ./pkg/sys/... passes\"\n      - id: 